---
import Section from '@/components/ui/Section.astro';
import Picture from '@/components/ui/Picture.astro';
---

<Section tone="stone" labelledby="what-title">
  <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr] lg:items-center lg:gap-16">
    <div>
      <h2 id="what-title" class="text-h2">
        What the Guild is
      </h2>
      <div class="mt-6 flex max-w-[60ch] flex-col gap-5 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Catholic labor guilds were once at the heart of Christian society. They united their
          communities through spiritual formation and the corporal works of mercy, and they fostered
          local economies by putting Catholic social teaching into practice. The fruit of these
          guilds was stable families, flourishing communities, and a robust Church.
        </p>
        <p>
          The St. Joseph the Worker Guild seeks to breathe new life into this rich Catholic
          tradition. We unite tradesmen in a Catholic brotherhood that will once again build up
          Christian society.
        </p>
        <p class="font-sans text-[0.95rem] text-ash">
          Consecrated to St. Joseph the Worker and St. Louis IX as patrons.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <Picture slot="guildAtWork" sizes="(min-width: 64rem) 45vw, 100vw" aspect="4 / 3" />
  </div>
</Section>
